    "detailed_description": "Screen King is a grid-based puzzle game where you need to merge your tiny LCD screens with the other LCD screens in the level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483430/extras/451b3bb929c4201244e7debb300b9cea.poster.avif?t=1687875631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483430/extras/451b3bb929c4201244e7debb300b9cea.webm?t=1687875631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483430/extras/451b3bb929c4201244e7debb300b9cea.mp4?t=1687875631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each screen of same value will merge together when they are next to each other.<br><br>To win a level, you must reach the goal number with your player-screen and make sure no other non-#0 screens are left in the level.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483430/extras/a443ff1b30b7d5ead9e7801193083015.poster.avif?t=1687875631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483430/extras/a443ff1b30b7d5ead9e7801193083015.webm?t=1687875631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483430/extras/a443ff1b30b7d5ead9e7801193083015.mp4?t=1687875631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30+ different blocks<br></li><li>64 main levels<br></li><li>16 extra challenging levels<br></li><li>A cute story<br></li><li>Relaxing music<br></li><li>And a detailed guide of the different mechanics</li></ul><br>Can you clear every screen in the game ?<br><br>Can you become the Screen King?",
